[h2]Build 0.9.9[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]The Colonists view now shows skill and passion on each work box: boxes are shaded by skill with the passion flame, as on the Work tab, and the skill level is written underneath (* marks a passion). The tooltip gives the exact skills, passions and the advisor's fit score.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Picking a colonist in the Colonists view also selects them in the game, so the Work tab and the rest of the interface follow.
[*]Bench work whose recipes use no skill at all is now treated as unskilled, even when the work type lists one. With Complex Jobs this covers Refine: making chemfuel does not use or train Crafting. This is worked out from the recipes in your game, so other mods' benches are counted.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
